%% Tool broker flow (planned, Phase 6). Explained in: docs/components/Tool_Broker.md
flowchart LR
    SB[Caged agent<br/>no raw secrets] -->|tool request| TB[aegis-tool-broker*]
    TB --> GW[/v1/authorize - same Cedar/approval semantics/]
    GW -->|deny| REF[refuse]
    GW -->|allow/approved| INJ[broker injects credential server-side]
    INJ --> PROV[provider API]
    PROV --> RESP[result to agent]
    INJ --> EVT[event + receipt - secrets redacted]
